dojo.cutscene3.1=&lt;§6Master Chow§r&gt; §dBueno, no ha estado mal. Me parece que ya puedes aprender una técnica más avanzada.	###Well, that wasn't terrible. You may be ready for a more advanced technique.  This is a dummy. No, not Stuart. This dummy. Look at the dummy! Doubt tells you you're not strong enough to break it. But doubt exists only in your mind ...assuming you have minds. We do not let doubt dominate our will. Strike the dummy. Charge your fury! And when you have found it deep within you! Unleash your Inner Beast!
